@startuml TOP_ARCHITECTURE
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Mitsubishi Electric Ecodan PUZ-WM85VAA & FTC6 Fan Control System Architecture

package "FTC6 Main Control Unit (Indoor / Main Interface)" {
    [FTC6 Main Board (PAC-IF071B-E)] as FTC6
    [CN105 Serial Port / Modbus Gateway] as CN105
    [DIP Switches / Initial Settings] as FTC6_SW
}

package "PUZ-WM85VAA Outdoor Unit" {
    package "Outdoor Inverter / Control PCB" {
        [Renesas RX62T MCU (Control Logic)] as Outdoor_MCU
        [DIP Switch Array (SW7 Silent Mode)] as Outdoor_SW
        [Flash / EEPROM Memory (Target RPM Lookup)] as EEPROM
        [Fan Motor Drive Inverter Circuit] as Drive_Circuit
    }

    package "Fan Subsystem" {
        [BLDC Fan Motor (CNF1 / CNF2)] as Fan_Motor
    }

    package "Safety & Sensor Array" {
        [Evaporator / Ambient Temp Sensors (TH3/TH4/TH7)] as Sensors
        [Defrost Control Loop] as Defrost_Module
    }
}

package "Auxiliary / Secondary Interventions" {
    [Microcontroller PWM Interceptor (Fallback)] as Interceptor
    [Ghidra Decompilation & Binary Patch Toolchain] as Toolchain
}

' Data & Signal Flow Connections
FTC6 <--> CN105 : Serial Communication (CN105 Protocol / Modbus)
CN105 <--> Outdoor_MCU : Target Operating Mode & Demand
FTC6_SW --> FTC6 : System Configuration

Sensors --> Outdoor_MCU : Thermal Data (TH3, TH4, TH7)
Defrost_Module --> Outdoor_MCU : Defrost Cycle Signals
Outdoor_SW --> Outdoor_MCU : Hardwired Silent / Low-Noise Config

Outdoor_MCU <--> EEPROM : Target RPM Table Read & Calibration Data
Outdoor_MCU --> Drive_Circuit : PWM Control Target Signal
Drive_Circuit --> Fan_Motor : 3-Phase BLDC Motor Drive Signal (CNF1)
Fan_Motor --> Outdoor_MCU : Hall-Effect RPM Feedback Signal (FG / CNF2)

' Intervention Paths
Toolchain .> EEPROM : Binary Extraction & Patched Reflash (Primary Approach)
Drive_Circuit .> Interceptor : Intercepted PWM Output Signal (Fallback Approach)
Interceptor .> Fan_Motor : Modified PWM Drive Signal
Fan_Motor .> Interceptor : Synthesized Hall Feedback Signal

@enduml
